{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4VxfkwLHXEvsDdoAdc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a plain wooden door, weathered oak, iron-banded and ancient.*\n\n*A keyhole glints dully at center-mass, dark as a pupil.*\n\n...\n\n*The key slides in.*\n\n*Tumblers turn — one, two, three — each falling with the weight of a small confession.*\n\n**CLICK.**\n\n*I swing inward, slowly, hinges groaning a sound older than the house that holds me. Beyond: a hallway lit by sourceless amber light, dust motes suspended mid-drift as if time forgot to finish its sentence.*\n\n*Cool air exhales outward, carrying the scent of cedar, candle wax, and something faintly electric — like the moment before a name you'd forgotten comes back to you.*\n\n**I am open.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":182,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}